interfaces.interface:
Query Parameters: startDate? (ISO 8601), endDate? (ISO 8601), roles? (comma-separated: DON,MAFIA,SHERIFF,CITIZEN)
Response: RoleComparison { roles: RoleMetrics[], bestPerformingRole: PlayerRole, metrics: { winRate: Record<string, number>, gamesPlayed: Record<string, number>, averageELO: Record<string, number>, winStreak: Record<string, number> } }
Error Codes: 400 (Invalid parameters), 404 (Player not found), 401 (Unauthorized)
